Result**: Test fails as expected with assertion error\n\nProceeding to Green phase.</think>"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.read:93","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"src/claim-office.ts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/kimi-k2.7-code","usage":{"input":603,"output":243,"cacheRead":60416,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":125,"totalTokens":61262,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784924098225,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-fbd0e8cf-d2ab-4d5a-ae0e-3dfc357674dc","responseModel":"moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"functions.read:93","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"type Item = {\n  type: string;\n  material?: string;\n  enchantment?: number;\n  cursed?: boolean;\n};\n\ntype Customer = {\n  yearsWithMHPCO: number;\n};\n\nconst CENTS_PER_GOLD = 100;\n\nconst BASE_FEE = 5;\nconst SWORD_PREMIUM = 100;\nconst AMULET_PREMIUM = 60;\nconst COMPONENT_PREMIUM = 25;\nconst COMPONENT_BLOCK_PREMIUM = 60;\nconst COMPONENTS_PER_BLOCK = 3;\n\nconst LOYALTY_DISCOUNT_YEARS = 2;\nconst LOYALTY_DISCOUNT_RATE = 0.2;\nconst INSURANCE_CONTRACT_SURCHARGE_RATE = 0.1;\nconst FOLLOW_UP_CONTRACT_DISCOUNT_RATE = 0.15;\n\nconst HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_THRESHOLD = 5;\nconst CURSED_SURCHARGE_RATE = 0.5;\nconst HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_SURCHARGE_RATE = 0.3;\n\nconst countByType = (items: Item[], type: string): number =>\n  items.filter((item) => item.type === type).length;\n\nconst premiumForComponentCount = (count: number): number => {\n  if (count === COMPONENTS_PER_BLOCK) {\n    return COMPONENT_BLOCK_PREMIUM;\n  }\n  return count * COMPONENT_PREMIUM;\n};\n\nconst premiumForComponentsOfType = (items: Item[], type: string): number =>\n  premiumForComponentCount(countByType(items, type));\n\nconst basePremiumFor = (item: Item): number => {\n  if (item.type === \"sword\") return SWORD_PREMIUM;\n  if (item.type === \"amulet\") return AMULET_PREMIUM;\n  return 0;\n};\n\nconst usesEquipmentPricing = (items: Item[]): boolean =>\n  items.length > 0 && (items[0].type === \"sword\" || items[0].type === \"amulet\");\n\nconst sumBy = <T>(items: T[], valueFor: (item: T) => number): number =>\n  items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + valueFor(item), 0);\n\nconst isHighlyEnchanted = (item: Item): boolean =>\n  item.enchantment !== undefined && item.enchantment >= HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_THRESHOLD;\n\nconst itemSurchargeCents = (item: Item): number => {\n  let modifier = 0;\n  const base = basePremiumFor(item);\n  if (item.cursed) {\n    modifier += base * CURSED_SURCHARGE_RATE;\n  }\n  if (isHighlyEnchanted(item)) {\n    modifier += base * HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_SURCHARGE_RATE;\n  }\n  return modifier * CENTS_PER_GOLD;\n};\n\nconst roundUpCentsToGold = (cents: number): number =>\n  Math.ceil(cents / CENTS_PER_GOLD);\n\nconst policyAdjustmentRate = (\n  customer: Customer,\n  contractIndex: number | null,\n): number => {\n  const qualifiesForLoyaltyDiscount = customer.yearsWithMHPCO >= LOYALTY_DISCOUNT_YEARS;\n  const hasInsuranceContract = contractIndex !== null;\n  const isFollowUpContract = hasInsuranceContract && contractIndex > 0;\n\n  return (\n    (qualifiesForLoyaltyDiscount ? -LOYALTY_DISCOUNT_RATE : 0) +\n    (hasInsuranceContract ? INSURANCE_CONTRACT_SURCHARGE_RATE : 0) +\n    (isFollowUpContract ? -FOLLOW_UP_CONTRACT_DISCOUNT_RATE : 0)\n  );\n};\n\nexport const quote = (\n  customer: Customer,\n  insuredItems: Item[],\n  contractIndex: number | null = null,\n): number => {\n  if (usesEquipmentPricing(insuredItems)) {\n    const baseCents = sumBy(\n      insuredItems,\n      (item) => basePremiumFor(item) * CENTS_PER_GOLD,\n    );\n    const itemSurchargeTotal = sumBy(insuredItems, itemSurchargeCents);\n    const policyRate = policyAdjustmentRate(customer, contractIndex);\n    const policyAdjustmentCents = baseCents * policyRate;\n    const totalCents =\n      baseCents + itemSurchargeTotal + policyAdjustmentCents + BASE_FEE * CENTS_PER_GOLD;\n    return roundUpCentsToGold(totalCents);\n  }\n  return (\n    BASE_FEE +\n    premiumForComponentsOfType(insuredItems, \"rune\") +\n    premiumForComponentsOfType(insuredItems, \"moonstone\")\n  );\n};\n\nexport const claim = (policy: any, incident: any): any => {\n  return undefined;\n};\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784924100357},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to unify quote. Let me add a function `basePremiumForItem` that handles components too, and a function for component base premium sum. Then quote always does the same logic.\n\nFor components, I need to know which types are components. Currently rune and moonstone. I can treat any non-sword/amulet as component, but for now just rune/moonstone.\n\nLet me rewrite.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.write:94","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"src/claim-office.ts","content":"type Item = {\n  type: string;\n  material?: string;\n  enchantment?: number;\n  cursed?: boolean;\n};\n\ntype Customer = {\n  yearsWithMHPCO: number;\n};\n\nconst CENTS_PER_GOLD = 100;\n\nconst BASE_FEE = 5;\nconst SWORD_PREMIUM = 100;\nconst AMULET_PREMIUM = 60;\nconst STAFF_PREMIUM = 80;\nconst POTION_PREMIUM = 40;\nconst COMPONENT_PREMIUM = 25;\nconst COMPONENT_BLOCK_PREMIUM = 60;\nconst COMPONENTS_PER_BLOCK = 3;\n\nconst LOYALTY_DISCOUNT_YEARS = 2;\nconst LOYALTY_DISCOUNT_RATE = 0.2;\nconst INSURANCE_CONTRACT_SURCHARGE_RATE = 0.1;\nconst FOLLOW_UP_CONTRACT_DISCOUNT_RATE = 0.15;\n\nconst HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_THRESHOLD = 5;\nconst CURSED_SURCHARGE_RATE = 0.5;\nconst HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_SURCHARGE_RATE = 0.3;\n\nconst countByType = (items: Item[], type: string): number =>\n  items.filter((item) => item.type === type).length;\n\nconst premiumForComponentCount = (count: number): number => {\n  if (count === COMPONENTS_PER_BLOCK) {\n    return COMPONENT_BLOCK_PREMIUM;\n  }\n  return count * COMPONENT_PREMIUM;\n};\n\nconst premiumForComponentsOfType = (items: Item[], type: string): number =>\n  premiumForComponentCount(countByType(items, type));\n\nconst basePremiumFor = (item: Item): number => {\n  if (item.type === \"sword\") return SWORD_PREMIUM;\n  if (item.type === \"amulet\") return AMULET_PREMIUM;\n  if (item.type === \"staff\") return STAFF_PREMIUM;\n  if (item.type === \"potion\") return POTION_PREMIUM;\n  return 0;\n};\n\nconst isComponentType = (type: string): boolean =>\n  type === \"rune\" || type === \"moonstone\";\n\nconst componentBasePremium = (items: Item[]): number =>\n  premiumForComponentsOfType(items, \"rune\") +\n  premiumForComponentsOfType(items, \"moonstone\");\n\nconst itemBasePremium = (item: Item): number => {\n  if (isComponentType(item.type)) {\n    return 0;\n  }\n  return basePremiumFor(item);\n};\n\nconst sumBy = <T>(items: T[], valueFor: (item: T) => number): number =>\n  items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + valueFor(item), 0);\n\nconst isHighlyEnchanted = (item: Item): boolean =>\n  item.enchantment !== undefined && item.enchantment >= HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_THRESHOLD;\n\nconst itemSurchargeCents = (item: Item): number => {\n  let modifier = 0;\n  const base = basePremiumFor(item);\n  if (item.cursed) {\n    modifier += base * CURSED_SURCHARGE_RATE;\n  }\n  if (isHighlyEnchanted(item)) {\n    modifier += base * HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_SURCHARGE_RATE;\n  }\n  return modifier * CENTS_PER_GOLD;\n};\n\nconst roundUpCentsToGold = (cents: number): number =>\n  Math.ceil(cents / CENTS_PER_GOLD);\n\nconst policyAdjustmentRate = (\n  customer: Customer,\n  contractIndex: number | null,\n): number => {\n  const qualifiesForLoyaltyDiscount = customer.yearsWithMHPCO >= LOYALTY_DISCOUNT_YEARS;\n  const hasInsuranceContract = contractIndex !== null;\n  const isFollowUpContract = hasInsuranceContract && contractIndex > 0;\n\n  return (\n    (qualifiesForLoyaltyDiscount ? -LOYALTY_DISCOUNT_RATE : 0) +\n    (hasInsuranceContract ? INSURANCE_CONTRACT_SURCHARGE_RATE : 0) +\n    (isFollowUpContract ? -FOLLOW_UP_CONTRACT_DISCOUNT_RATE : 0)\n  );\n};\n\nexport const quote = (\n  customer: Customer,\n  insuredItems: Item[],\n  contractIndex: number | null = null,\n): number => {\n  const baseCents =\n    sumBy(insuredItems, (item) => itemBasePremium(item) * CENTS_PER_GOLD) +\n    componentBasePremium(insuredItems) * CENTS_PER_GOLD;\n  const itemSurchargeTotal = sumBy(insuredItems, itemSurchargeCents);\n  const policyRate = policyAdjustmentRate(customer, contractIndex);\n  const policyAdjustmentCents = baseCents * policyRate;\n  const totalCents =\n    baseCents + itemSurchargeTotal + policyAdjustmentCents + BASE_FEE * CENTS_PER_GOLD;\n  return roundUpCentsToGold(totalCents);\n};\n\nexport const claim = (policy: any, incident: any): any => {\n  return undefined;\n};\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/kimi-k2.7-code","usage":{"input":995,"output":1293,"cacheRead":61248,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":85,"totalTokens":63536,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784924100364,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-327040f4-2c86-40c4-82e6-1711509b6381","responseModel":"moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"functions.write:94","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 3687 bytes to src/claim-office.ts"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784924108913},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Run tests.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.bash:95","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"pnpm test","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/kimi-k2.7-code","usage":{"input":76,"output":28,"cacheRead":63488,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":4,"totalTokens":63592,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784924108920,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-ac2aa7a4-dc11-4646-bcb6-703310012ef4","responseModel":"moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code"}