};\n","firstChangedLine":142},"isError":false,"timestamp":1784924519104},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Run tests.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.bash:114","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"pnpm test","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/kimi-k2.7-code","usage":{"input":63,"output":28,"cacheRead":73536,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":4,"totalTokens":73627,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784924519110,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-c75b865b-259a-4966-8dff-c4ed1532ccb5","responseModel":"moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"functions.bash:114","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n> tdd-experiment-run@ test /home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_19-41-05_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_kimi-k2-7\n> vitest run\n\n\n RUN  v1.6.1 /home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_19-41-05_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_kimi-k2-7\n\n ✓ src/claim-office.spec.ts  (30 tests | 9 skipped) 5ms\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  21 passed | 9 todo (30)\n   Start at  20:22:00\n   Duration  160ms (transform 31ms, setup 0ms, collect 30ms, tests 5ms, environment 0ms, prepare 43ms)\n\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784924520776},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## Green -- Test 21: added high-enchantment damage rule to claim\n\nGreen Phase Complete:\n**Implementation**: Added item lookup and high-enchantment damage payout rule\n**Result**: All tests now pass (21 passing)\n**Approach**: Find matching policy item and apply 50% reimbursement for enchantment >= 8\n\nProceeding to Refactor phase.</think>"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.subagent:115","name":"subagent","arguments":{"agent":"refactor","age